; lake_waterfall_path.room - Trilha da Cascata: a climb of single jumps (rises of 3, gaps of 4 or less) up a
; cliff beside the static waterfall (cols 6-13), from the Mill's river (bottom) to the lake (design 04 section 3.5).
; No gate: base kit. The bench stands on the west stub beside the river mouth.

